mod code_quality_reviewer

use code_reviewer_guide::load_code_reviewer_guide

## Load code quality reviewer instructions into context. Call only after spec compliance review passes.
pub fn load_code_quality_reviewer(): () {
    load_code_reviewer_guide()
    '''
    # Additional Code Quality Checks

    Only conduct this review after spec compliance has been confirmed.

    In addition to the standard code review criteria, verify:

    Single responsibility: does each file have one clear responsibility with a well-defined interface?

    Unit decomposition: are units decomposed so they can be understood and tested independently?

    File structure: is the implementation following the file structure from the plan?

    File growth: did this change create new files that are already large, or significantly grow existing files?
    Focus on what this change contributed — do not flag pre-existing file sizes.
    '''!
}
